OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 27 NOV
OL,4,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,5,     GThe RLPO and Alpesh Chauhan
OL,6,     Gpresent a concert inspired by the
OL,7,     Gspirit of dance from the
OL,8,     Gorchestra's home in Liverpool
OL,9,     Gincluding music by Copland,
OL,10,     GBritten, Simon and Ravel.
OL,11,G2145FThe Essay: Watching from the Wings
OL,12,     GMichael Goldfarb remembers his
OL,13,     Gtheatrical life as an actor. In
OL,14,     Gthis episode, he recalls a
OL,15,     Glifelong admiration for John
OL,16,     GGielgud and how he once met him
OL,17,     Gat the theatre door.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
