OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 27 NOV
OL,4,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,5,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,6,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,7,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,8,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,9,     Geverything in between.
OL,10,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,11,     GThis week, Soweto's guest for has
OL,12,     Gbeen trombonist and producer
OL,13,     GRosie Turton. To conclude her
OL,14,     Gweek, Rosie picks a much-loved
OL,15,     Grecord by a seminal British
OL,16,     Gexperimental jazz band.
